# Product scope

- [`docs/PRD.md`](docs/PRD.md) is the source of truth for scope and flows. [`docs/wireframes/TuneTalez_Wireframes.pdf`](docs/wireframes/TuneTalez_Wireframes.pdf) is the layout reference. On conflicts, the PRD wins (PRD §7).
- Build only what is in the current phase (PRD §6). Anything else → ask before building.
- When scope changes, update the PRD in the same commit.
